  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 523.06,
      "e": 524.44,
      "text": "the bed down they can't go home."
    },
    {
      "s": 524.44,
      "e": 525.54,
      "text": "Why are you sitting through the eight,"
    },
    {
      "s": 525.54,
      "e": 527.22,
      "text": "the people like that?"
    },
    {
      "s": 527.22,
      "e": 528.98,
      "text": "Beyond that, if you want to go home tonight,"
    },
    {
      "s": 528.98,
      "e": 536.58,
      "text": "that's every armory, I certainly don't want to make sure"
    },
    {
      "s": 536.58,
      "e": 538.62,
      "text": "that all the green vehicles are topped off"
    },
    {
      "s": 539.62,
      "e": 542.06,
      "text": "and somewhere in the armory we're expecting a flood."
    },
    {
      "s": 542.06,
      "e": 544.5,
      "text": "And then we'll release for the night, okay?"
    },
    {
      "s": 544.5,
      "e": 546.78,
      "text": "I do not know if we would follow on Michigan in the morning,"
    },
    {
      "s": 546.78,
      "e": 549.66,
      "text": "so I'm not gonna release you from day after duty tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "s": 549.66,
      "e": 565.87,
      "text": "So I'm pleased in the morning,"
    },
    {
      "s": 565.87,
      "e": 568.59,
      "text": "once a month or a more than happy that we showed up"
    },
    {
      "s": 568.59,
      "e": 570.23,
      "text": "and you all did what you do best."
    },
    {
      "s": 570.23,
      "e": 575.23,
      "text": "So it is now 1148 local, excuse me, 2348 local."
    },
    {
      "s": 577.71,
      "e": 579.27,
      "text": "When you get back to Gary armory,"
    },
    {
      "s": 579.27,
      "e": 581.75,
      "text": "find out who's staying where and then we'll release it."
    },
    {
      "s": 581.75,
      "e": 584.39,
      "text": "Like we'll release here, release us for another hour."
    },
    {
      "s": 584.39,
      "e": 586.19,
      "text": "Is that doable?"
    },
    {
      "s": 586.19,
      "e": 587.55,
      "text": "Senior NTOs, can we do that?"
    },
    {
      "s": 587.55,
      "e": 588.55,
      "text": "Well, that's sure."
    },
    {
      "s": 588.55,
      "e": 592.95,
      "text": "Okay, so that's the intent."
    },
    {
      "s": 592.95,
      "e": 596.15,
      "text": "First start, Staley, I need you and the intent"
    },
    {
      "s": 596.15,
      "e": 597.75,
      "text": "is starting to make sure that all the folks we have"
    },
    {
      "s": 597.75,
      "e": 600.19,
      "text": "from the 113th, we have good phone numbers on,"
    },
    {
      "s": 600.19,
      "e": 601.43,
      "text": "and then we, before we release,"
    },
    {
      "s": 601.43,
      "e": 603.23,
      "text": "I wanna make sure we have a good first phone rate"
    },
    {
      "s": 603.23,
      "e": 605.07,
      "text": "of time in the morning, huh?"
    },
    {
      "s": 605.07,
      "e": 605.91,
      "text": "All right."
    },
    {
      "s": 606.87,
      "e": 608.39,
      "text": "Ladies and gentlemen, any questions?"
    }
